u-&gt;f : getCardsToReview(courseId)
f-&gt;s : getCardsToReview(course)
s.&gt;u : unreviewed then lower-mastery cards
u-&gt;f : reviewCard(courseId, cardId, remembered)
f-&gt;s : review(course, card, remembered)
s: recordReview and create stable StudyEvent ID
s-&gt;c : saveCourse(course with card and review event)
c.&gt;s : saved
s-&gt;t : recordReview(course, event)
t: save copied counts before exposing them
t-&gt;o : update(subject)
o.&gt;u : history and refreshed dashboard
t:A later failed derived write can be repaired from the saved course event</panel_attributes>
